    "Asks nothing and runs straight through. The first time on a machine you must accept a warning on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什么都不问,一路到底;该机器首次需在电脑上接受一次警告"
